{"dish":"Garlic Parmesan Pasta","ingredients":[{"name":"spaghetti","quantity":"200g"},{"name":"garlic","quantity":"2 cloves"},{"name":"parmesan","quantity":"50g"},{"name":"parsley","quantity":"a handful"},{"name":"salt","quantity":"to taste"},{"name":"pepper","quantity":"to taste"},{"name":"oil","quantity":"1 tbsp"},{"name":"butter","quantity":"1 tbsp"}],"steps":["Boil a pot of water and cook spaghetti until al dente, then drain (reserve a splash of pasta water).","Mince garlic. In a pan, melt butter with oil over medium heat and sauté garlic until fragrant but not browned.",
